Aegis-V (16-buildtools README): when fchdir() fails with ENOSYS (Tilck), ftw
enters a directory with chdir() of the whole path from the start, but the
cwd is already its parent (du of nested directories: "cannot change to
directory"); the last component is the right name.

--- coreutils-5.0/lib/ftw.c
+++ coreutils-5.0/lib/ftw.c
@@ -517,7 +517,8 @@
 	{
 	  if (errno == ENOSYS)
 	    {
-	      if (__chdir (data->dirbuf) < 0)
+	      /* the cwd is the parent: its name, not the whole path */
+	      if (__chdir (data->dirbuf + data->ftw.base) < 0)
 		result = -1;
 	    }
 	  else
